OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigating unnotified
OL,4,Aparade in north Belfast
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn police investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched following reports of an
OL,8,Funnotified parade in north Belfast.
OL,10,FThe parade is believed to have taken
OL,11,Fplace in the Shankill Road area on
OL,12,FMonday.
OL,14,FEnquiries are currently ongoing into
OL,15,Fthe incident.
OL,17,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,18,Fhas appealed for anyone with
OL,19,Finformation to come forward.
